This license covers the source code of this repository only.

`data/questions.json` contains correct answers, field classifications and
short excerpts of question stems derived from past examinations published by
the Information-technology Promotion Agency, Japan (IPA). Copyright in those
examination questions is retained by IPA and is NOT granted under the MIT
license above. IPA states that no permission or usage fee is required to use
its published past examination questions, provided the source is cited; each
item in this repository carries that citation. See:
https://www.ipa.go.jp/shiken/faq.html

PDF booklets published by IPA are not included in this repository; they are
downloaded from IPA by scripts/build_dataset.py.
